<!--
    Static fallback palette for the AvalonDock ComponentResourceKeys.

    This dictionary is merged by Themes/Generic.xaml, which is the assembly's WPF theme
    dictionary. WPF resolves ComponentResourceKey/SystemResourceKey lookups that miss the
    element/application resource trees through SystemResources.FindDictionaryResource, and
    that code path calls Freezable.Freeze() on whatever it finds. A Freezable whose property
    is set with a DynamicResource (or a Binding) cannot be frozen, so any such value reachable
    from here throws "This Freezable cannot be frozen" the moment a lookup falls through -
    for example while a template subtree is being detached during a resize after an RDP
    reconnect.

    Rules for this file:
      * literal values only - never DynamicResource, StaticResource or Binding
      * every Freezable carries po:Freeze="True" so a violation fails at load time

    The live, theme-following brushes live in Themes/Mosaic.xaml, which is merged into
    DockingManager.Resources via the DockingManager.Theme property (MosaicTheme) and is
    therefore never subject to the freezing lookup path. Keep the two files in sync; the
    values below mirror the Mosaic Light theme.
-->
<ResourceDictionary
    xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml"
    xmlns:po="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation/options"
    xmlns:effects="clr-namespace:System.Windows.Media.Effects;assembly=PresentationCore"
    xmlns:menuKeys="clr-namespace:Mosaic.UI.Wpf.AvalonDock.Themes.VisualStudio.Menu"
    xmlns:reskeys="clr-namespace:Mosaic.UI.Wpf.AvalonDock.Themes.VisualStudio"
    xmlns:sys="clr-namespace:System;assembly=mscorlib">

